codex
The failure is now isolated to the sandbox’s PID namespace: Lean calls `readlink("/proc/<getpid()>/exe")`, but this environment exposes `/proc/self/exe` while `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe` is absent. I’m applying a narrow runtime shim that rewrites only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, then rerunning the unchanged trusted preflight. The diagnosis and shim source will remain in evidence.
apply patch
